{"seq":2,"slug":"dart-io-networking","title":"IO 与网络编程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/dart-language-async/core-libraries/dart-io-networking","wordCount":777,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"io-与网络编程\">IO 与网络编程</h1><p><code>dart:io</code> 是 Dart 原生平台（非 Web）的系统交互层，提供文件系统操作、TCP/UDP 网络、HTTP 客户端与服务端、进程管理和平台信息查询。整个库的设计围绕异步 IO 展开——文件读取返回 Future，Socket 通信基于 Stream，HTTP 服务器用 Stream 接收请求。这使得 Dart 的 IO 代码天然适配事件循环模型，不会阻塞主线程。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>先立起本篇的几张底牌，后文所有论证都围绕它们展开：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>一句话定义</th>\n<th>在本篇中的角色</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>异步优先</td>\n<td>文件/Socket/HTTP 全以 Future 或 Stream 暴露</td>\n<td>不阻塞事件循环的设计前提</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同步 API 边界</td>\n<td>同步接口仅用于脚本工具或 Isolate 内部</td>\n<td>何时可以破例的经验规则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>流式处理</td>\n<td><code>openRead</code>/<code>openWrite</code> 逐块读写，内存恒定</td>\n<td>大文件与进度回调的基础</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Socket 层</td>\n<td>低层 TCP/UDP，用于自定义协议</td>\n<td>HTTP 之下的可编程网络原语</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Stream 化 IO</td>\n<td>目录监控、进程输出都以 Stream 交付</td>\n<td>与响应式管道天然对接</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平台抽象</td>\n<td><code>Platform</code> 查询 OS、核心数与环境变量</td>\n<td>跨平台路径与条件逻辑的依据</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话串起来：<code>dart:io</code> 的一切都围绕异步 IO 设计，返回 Future 或 Stream，因此天然适配事件循环；同步接口与低层 Socket 是留给脚本与自定义协议的补充。</p>\n<h2 id=\"文件系统操作\">文件系统操作</h2><p><code>dart:io</code> 的文件 API 提供同步和异步两套接口。异步接口应作为默认选择——同步接口仅在脚本工具或 Isolate 内部使用：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"import &#39;dart:io&#39;;&#10;import &#39;dart:convert&#39;;&#10;&#10;// 异步读写（推荐）&#10;Future&lt;void&gt; processConfigFile() async {&#10;  final file = File(&#39;/etc/app/config.json&#39;);&#10;&#10;  // 检查文件是否存在&#10;  if (!await file.exists()) {&#10;    await file.create(recursive: true);&#10;    await file.writeAsString(&#39;{}&#39;);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  // 读取并解析&#10;  final content = await file.readAsString();&#10;  final config = jsonDecode(content) as Map&lt;String, dynamic&gt;;&#10;&#10;  // 修改并写回（原子写入：先写临时文件再重命名）&#10;  config[&#39;lastModified&#39;] = DateTime.now().toIso8601String();&#10;  await file.writeAsString(&#10;    jsonEncode(config),&#10;    mode: FileMode.write,&#10;    flush: true, // 确保数据落盘&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import 'dart:io';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import 'dart:convert';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 异步读写（推荐）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Future&#x3C;void> processConfigFile() async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final file = File('/etc/app/config.json');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // 检查文件是否存在</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if (!await file.exists()) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    await file.create(recursive: true);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    await file.writeAsString('{}');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // 读取并解析</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final content = await file.readAsString();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final config = jsonDecode(content) as Map&#x3C;String, dynamic>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // 修改并写回（原子写入：先写临时文件再重命名）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  config['lastModified'] = DateTime.now().toIso8601String();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  await file.writeAsString(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    jsonEncode(config),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    mode: FileMode.write,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    flush: true, // 确保数据落盘</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>大文件处理使用 Stream 逐块读取，避免将整个文件加载到内存：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// 流式处理大文件（内存恒定，不受文件大小影响）&#10;Future&lt;int&gt; countLines(String path) async {&#10;  final stream = File(path)&#10;      .openRead()&#10;      .transform(utf8.decoder)&#10;      .transform(const LineSplitter());&#10;&#10;  var count = 0;&#10;  await for (final _ in stream) {&#10;    count++;&#10;  }&#10;  return count;&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 流式复制（带进度回调）&#10;Future&lt;void&gt; copyWithProgress(&#10;  String src, String dst, void Function(double) onProgress,&#10;) async {&#10;  final sourceFile = File(src);&#10;  final totalBytes = await sourceFile.length();&#10;  var copiedBytes = 0;&#10;&#10;  final sink = File(dst).openWrite();&#10;  await for (final chunk in sourceFile.openRead()) {&#10;    sink.add(chunk);&#10;    copiedBytes += chunk.length;&#10;    onProgress(copiedBytes / totalBytes);&#10;  }&#10;  await sink.close();&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 流式处理大文件（内存恒定，不受文件大小影响）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Future&#x3C;int> countLines(String path) async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final stream = File(path)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      .openRead()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      .transform(utf8.decoder)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      .transform(const LineSplitter());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  var count = 0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  await for (final _ in stream) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    count++;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return count;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 流式复制（带进度回调）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Future&#x3C;void> copyWithProgress(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  String src, String dst, void Function(double) onProgress,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final sourceFile = File(src);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final totalBytes = await sourceFile.length();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  var copiedBytes = 0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final sink = File(dst).openWrite();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  await for (final chunk in sourceFile.openRead()) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    sink.add(chunk);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    copiedBytes += chunk.length;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    onProgress(copiedBytes / totalBytes);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  await sink.close();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>异步 API</th>\n<th>同步 API</th>\n<th>返回类型</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>读全部</td>\n<td><code>readAsString()</code></td>\n<td><code>readAsStringSync()</code></td>\n<td><code>Future&lt;String&gt;</code> / <code>String</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>读字节</td>\n<td><code>readAsBytes()</code></td>\n<td><code>readAsBytesSync()</code></td>\n<td><code>Future&lt;Uint8List&gt;</code> / <code>Uint8List</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>流式读</td>\n<td><code>openRead()</code></td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td><code>Stream&lt;List&lt;int&gt;&gt;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>写入</td>\n<td><code>writeAsString()</code></td>\n<td><code>writeAsStringSync()</code></td>\n<td><code>Future&lt;File&gt;</code> / <code>void</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>流式写</td>\n<td><code>openWrite()</code></td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td><code>IOSink</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"目录遍历与文件监控\">目录遍历与文件监控</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// 递归列出目录内容&#10;Future&lt;List&lt;FileSystemEntity&gt;&gt; findDartFiles(String root) async {&#10;  final dir = Directory(root);&#10;  return dir&#10;      .list(recursive: true)&#10;      .where((entity) =&gt; entity is File &amp;&amp; entity.path.endsWith(&#39;.dart&#39;))&#10;      .toList();&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 文件系统监控（实时检测变化）&#10;Stream&lt;FileSystemEvent&gt; watchDirectory(String path) {&#10;  return Directory(path).watch(&#10;    events: FileSystemEvent.all,&#10;    recursive: true,&#10;  );&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 使用示例：热重载文件监控&#10;Future&lt;void&gt; devServer(String srcDir) async {&#10;  await for (final event in watchDirectory(srcDir)) {&#10;    switch (event.type) {&#10;      case FileSystemEvent.modify:&#10;        print(&#39;Modified: ${event.path}&#39;);&#10;        await rebuildProject();&#10;      case FileSystemEvent.create:&#10;        print(&#39;Created: ${event.path}&#39;);&#10;      case FileSystemEvent.delete:&#10;        print(&#39;Deleted: ${event.path}&#39;);&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 递归列出目录内容</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Future&#x3C;List&#x3C;FileSystemEntity>> findDartFiles(String root) async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final dir = Directory(root);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return dir</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      .list(recursive: true)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      .where((entity) => entity is File &#x26;&#x26; entity.path.endsWith('.dart'))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      .toList();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 文件系统监控（实时检测变化）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Stream&#x3C;FileSystemEvent> watchDirectory(String path) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return Directory(path).watch(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    events: FileSystemEvent.all,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    recursive: true,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 使用示例：热重载文件监控</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Future&#x3C;void> devServer(String srcDir) async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  await for (final event in watchDirectory(srcDir)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    switch (event.type) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      case FileSystemEvent.modify:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        print('Modified: ${event.path}');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        await rebuildProject();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      case FileSystemEvent.create:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        print('Created: ${event.path}');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      case FileSystemEvent.delete:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        print('Deleted: ${event.path}');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"tcp-socket-编程\">TCP Socket 编程</h2><p><code>dart:io</code> 提供低层 TCP/UDP Socket，适合自定义协议实现：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// TCP 服务器&#10;Future&lt;void&gt; startEchoServer() async {&#10;  final server = await ServerSocket.bind(&#10;    InternetAddress.anyIPv4,&#10;    8080,&#10;    shared: true, // 允许多个 Isolate 共享端口&#10;  );&#10;  print(&#39;Server listening on port ${server.port}&#39;);&#10;&#10;  await for (final socket in server) {&#10;    _handleClient(socket);&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;void _handleClient(Socket socket) {&#10;  final address = socket.remoteAddress.address;&#10;  print(&#39;Client connected: $address&#39;);&#10;&#10;  socket.listen(&#10;    (data) {&#10;      // Echo: 将收到的数据原样返回&#10;      socket.add(data);&#10;    },&#10;    onError: (e) =&gt; print(&#39;Error from $address: $e&#39;),&#10;    onDone: () {&#10;      print(&#39;Client disconnected: $address&#39;);&#10;      socket.close();&#10;    },&#10;  );&#10;}&#10;&#10;// TCP 客户端&#10;Future&lt;String&gt; fetchFromTcp(String host, int port, String request) async {&#10;  final socket = await Socket.connect(host, port,&#10;    timeout: Duration(seconds: 5),&#10;  );&#10;  socket.write(request);&#10;  await socket.flush();&#10;  socket.close(); // 关闭写端&#10;&#10;  final response = await utf8.decoder.bind(socket).join();&#10;  return response;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// TCP 服务器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Future&#x3C;void> startEchoServer() async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final server = await ServerSocket.bind(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    InternetAddress.anyIPv4,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    8080,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    shared: true, // 允许多个 Isolate 共享端口</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  print('Server listening on port ${server.port}');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  await for (final socket in server) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    _handleClient(socket);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>void _handleClient(Socket socket) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final address = socket.remoteAddress.address;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  print('Client connected: $address');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  socket.listen(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    (data) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      // Echo: 将收到的数据原样返回</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      socket.add(data);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    onError: (e) => print('Error from $address: $e'),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    onDone: () {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      print('Client disconnected: $address');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      socket.close();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// TCP 客户端</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Future&#x3C;String> fetchFromTcp(String host, int port, String request) async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final socket = await Socket.connect(host, port,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    timeout: Duration(seconds: 5),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  socket.write(request);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  await socket.flush();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  socket.close(); // 关闭写端</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final response = await utf8.decoder.bind(socket).join();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return response;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant C as 客户端&#10;    participant S as 服务器&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;S: Socket.connect()&#10;    S--&gt;&gt;C: 连接建立&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;S: socket.write(request)&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;C: socket.add(response)&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;S: socket.close()&#10;    S--&gt;&gt;C: onDone 触发\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant C as 客户端\n    participant S as 服务器\n    C-&gt;&gt;S: Socket.connect()\n    S--&gt;&gt;C: 连接建立\n    C-&gt;&gt;S: socket.write(request)\n    S-&gt;&gt;C: socket.add(response)\n    C-&gt;&gt;S: socket.close()\n    S--&gt;&gt;C: onDone 触发</pre><h2 id=\"http-客户端与服务端\">HTTP 客户端与服务端</h2><p><code>dart:io</code> 内置 HTTP 实现，但社区通常使用 <code>package:http</code>（简单请求）或 <code>package:dio</code>（拦截器、重试等）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"import &#39;dart:io&#39;;&#10;&#10;// 内置 HttpClient（连接池、Cookie 管理、代理支持）&#10;Future&lt;Map&lt;String, dynamic&gt;&gt; fetchJson(Uri url) async {&#10;  final client = HttpClient()&#10;    ..connectionTimeout = Duration(seconds: 10)&#10;    ..idleTimeout = Duration(seconds: 15);&#10;&#10;  try {&#10;    final request = await client.getUrl(url);&#10;    request.headers.set(&#39;Accept&#39;, &#39;application/json&#39;);&#10;&#10;    final response = await request.close();&#10;    if (response.statusCode != 200) {&#10;      throw HttpException(&#39;Status ${response.statusCode}&#39;, uri: url);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    final body = await response.transform(utf8.decoder).join();&#10;    return jsonDecode(body) as Map&lt;String, dynamic&gt;;&#10;  } finally {&#10;    client.close(force: false); // 优雅关闭&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// HTTP 服务器&#10;Future&lt;HttpServer&gt; startApiServer() async {&#10;  final server = await HttpServer.bind(&#10;    InternetAddress.loopbackIPv4,&#10;    3000,&#10;  );&#10;  print(&#39;API server on http://localhost:${server.port}&#39;);&#10;&#10;  await for (final request in server) {&#10;    switch ((request.method, request.uri.path)) {&#10;      case (&#39;GET&#39;, &#39;/health&#39;):&#10;        request.response&#10;          ..statusCode = 200&#10;          ..headers.contentType = ContentType.json&#10;          ..write(&#39;{&quot;status&quot;:&quot;ok&quot;}&#39;);&#10;      case (&#39;GET&#39;, &#39;/api/users&#39;):&#10;        await _handleGetUsers(request);&#10;      default:&#10;        request.response.statusCode = 404;&#10;    }&#10;    await request.response.close();&#10;  }&#10;  return server;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import 'dart:io';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 内置 HttpClient（连接池、Cookie 管理、代理支持）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Future&#x3C;Map&#x3C;String, dynamic>> fetchJson(Uri url) async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final client = HttpClient()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ..connectionTimeout = Duration(seconds: 10)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ..idleTimeout = Duration(seconds: 15);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  try {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    final request = await client.getUrl(url);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    request.headers.set('Accept', 'application/json');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    final response = await request.close();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (response.statusCode != 200) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      throw HttpException('Status ${response.statusCode}', uri: url);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    final body = await response.transform(utf8.decoder).join();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return jsonDecode(body) as Map&#x3C;String, dynamic>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  } finally {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    client.close(force: false); // 优雅关闭</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// HTTP 服务器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Future&#x3C;HttpServer> startApiServer() async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final server = await HttpServer.bind(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    InternetAddress.loopbackIPv4,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    3000,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  print('API server on http://localhost:${server.port}');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  await for (final request in server) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    switch ((request.method, request.uri.path)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      case ('GET', '/health'):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        request.response</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          ..statusCode = 200</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          ..headers.contentType = ContentType.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          ..write('{\"status\":\"ok\"}');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      case ('GET', '/api/users'):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        await _handleGetUsers(request);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      default:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        request.response.statusCode = 404;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    await request.response.close();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return server;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"websocket-通信\">WebSocket 通信</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// WebSocket 服务端&#10;Future&lt;void&gt; startWebSocketServer() async {&#10;  final server = await HttpServer.bind(&#39;localhost&#39;, 8765);&#10;&#10;  await for (final request in server) {&#10;    if (WebSocketTransformer.isUpgradeRequest(request)) {&#10;      final ws = await WebSocketTransformer.upgrade(request);&#10;      _handleWebSocket(ws);&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;void _handleWebSocket(WebSocket ws) {&#10;  ws.listen(&#10;    (message) {&#10;      // 广播消息或处理命令&#10;      ws.add(&#39;Echo: $message&#39;);&#10;    },&#10;    onDone: () =&gt; print(&#39;WebSocket closed: ${ws.closeCode}&#39;),&#10;  );&#10;}&#10;&#10;// WebSocket 客户端&#10;Future&lt;void&gt; connectChat(String url) async {&#10;  final ws = await WebSocket.connect(url);&#10;  ws.add(&#39;Hello from Dart!&#39;);&#10;&#10;  await for (final message in ws) {&#10;    print(&#39;Received: $message&#39;);&#10;    if (message == &#39;quit&#39;) {&#10;      await ws.close(WebSocketStatus.normalClosure);&#10;      break;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// WebSocket 服务端</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Future&#x3C;void> startWebSocketServer() async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final server = await HttpServer.bind('localhost', 8765);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  await for (final request in server) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (WebSocketTransformer.isUpgradeRequest(request)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      final ws = await WebSocketTransformer.upgrade(request);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      _handleWebSocket(ws);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>void _handleWebSocket(WebSocket ws) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ws.listen(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    (message) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      // 广播消息或处理命令</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      ws.add('Echo: $message');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    onDone: () => print('WebSocket closed: ${ws.closeCode}'),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// WebSocket 客户端</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Future&#x3C;void> connectChat(String url) async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final ws = await WebSocket.connect(url);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ws.add('Hello from Dart!');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  await for (final message in ws) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    print('Received: $message');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (message == 'quit') {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      await ws.close(WebSocketStatus.normalClosure);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      break;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"进程管理\">进程管理</h2><p><code>dart:io</code> 的 Process API 允许启动和管理外部进程：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// 运行命令并获取输出&#10;Future&lt;String&gt; runCommand(String cmd, List&lt;String&gt; args) async {&#10;  final result = await Process.run(cmd, args,&#10;    workingDirectory: &#39;/tmp&#39;,&#10;    environment: {&#39;LANG&#39;: &#39;en_US.UTF-8&#39;},&#10;  );&#10;  if (result.exitCode != 0) {&#10;    throw ProcessException(cmd, args, result.stderr as String, result.exitCode);&#10;  }&#10;  return result.stdout as String;&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 流式处理进程输出&#10;Future&lt;void&gt; streamBuild() async {&#10;  final process = await Process.start(&#39;dart&#39;, [&#39;compile&#39;, &#39;exe&#39;, &#39;bin/main.dart&#39;]);&#10;&#10;  process.stdout.transform(utf8.decoder).listen(print);&#10;  process.stderr.transform(utf8.decoder).listen((s) =&gt; print(&#39;ERR: $s&#39;));&#10;&#10;  final exitCode = await process.exitCode;&#10;  print(&#39;Build exited with code $exitCode&#39;);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 运行命令并获取输出</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Future&#x3C;String> runCommand(String cmd, List&#x3C;String> args) async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final result = await Process.run(cmd, args,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    workingDirectory: '/tmp',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    environment: {'LANG': 'en_US.UTF-8'},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if (result.exitCode != 0) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    throw ProcessException(cmd, args, result.stderr as String, result.exitCode);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return result.stdout as String;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 流式处理进程输出</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Future&#x3C;void> streamBuild() async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final process = await Process.start('dart', ['compile', 'exe', 'bin/main.dart']);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  process.stdout.transform(utf8.decoder).listen(print);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  process.stderr.transform(utf8.decoder).listen((s) => print('ERR: $s'));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final exitCode = await process.exitCode;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  print('Build exited with code $exitCode');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"平台检测与环境\">平台检测与环境</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// 平台信息&#10;final os = Platform.operatingSystem;     // &#39;macos&#39;, &#39;linux&#39;, &#39;windows&#39;&#10;final cores = Platform.numberOfProcessors; // CPU 核心数&#10;final env = Platform.environment;         // 环境变量 Map&#10;&#10;// 条件逻辑&#10;String getConfigPath() =&gt; switch (Platform.operatingSystem) {&#10;  &#39;macos&#39; =&gt; &#39;${Platform.environment[&#39;HOME&#39;]}/Library/Application Support/myapp&#39;,&#10;  &#39;linux&#39; =&gt; &#39;${Platform.environment[&#39;HOME&#39;]}/.config/myapp&#39;,&#10;  &#39;windows&#39; =&gt; &#39;${Platform.environment[&#39;APPDATA&#39;]}\\\\myapp&#39;,&#10;  _ =&gt; &#39;./config&#39;,&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 平台信息</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final os = Platform.operatingSystem;     // 'macos', 'linux', 'windows'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final cores = Platform.numberOfProcessors; // CPU 核心数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final env = Platform.environment;         // 环境变量 Map</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 条件逻辑</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>String getConfigPath() => switch (Platform.operatingSystem) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  'macos' => '${Platform.environment['HOME']}/Library/Application Support/myapp',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  'linux' => '${Platform.environment['HOME']}/.config/myapp',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  'windows' => '${Platform.environment['APPDATA']}\\\\myapp',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  _ => './config',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>};</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><code>dart:io</code> 是原生平台的系统交互层，全部 API 围绕异步 IO 设计：读文件返回 Future，Socket 与目录监控、进程输出基于 Stream。</li>\n<li>异步接口是默认选择，同步接口只在脚本工具或 Isolate 内部使用；写文件配合 <code>flush: true</code> 确保落盘。</li>\n<li>大文件必须流式处理：<code>openRead</code>/<code>openWrite</code> 逐块读写，内存占用与文件大小无关，并可顺带实现进度回调。</li>\n<li>低层 <code>ServerSocket</code>/<code>Socket</code> 适合自定义协议，<code>shared: true</code> 允许多 Isolate 共享端口；连接生命周期通过 <code>onDone</code> 收尾。</li>\n<li>HTTP 客户端与服务端都能直接用 <code>dart:io</code> 实现，复杂需求再引入 <code>package:http</code> 或 <code>package:dio</code>。</li>\n<li>跨平台路径与行为差异通过 <code>Platform.operatingSystem</code> 等查询以 switch 表达式统一处理。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>参阅 <a href=\"collections-algorithms\">集合与算法库</a> 了解 IO 操作中常用的缓冲区和数据结构选择，以及 <a href=\"dart-ffi-interop\">FFI 与原生互操作</a> 了解当 <code>dart:io</code> 性能不够时如何直接调用系统调用。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"IO 与网络编程","id":"io-与网络编程"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"文件系统操作","id":"文件系统操作"},{"level":2,"text":"目录遍历与文件监控","id":"目录遍历与文件监控"},{"level":2,"text":"TCP Socket 编程","id":"tcp-socket-编程"},{"level":2,"text":"HTTP 客户端与服务端","id":"http-客户端与服务端"},{"level":2,"text":"WebSocket 通信","id":"websocket-通信"},{"level":2,"text":"进程管理","id":"进程管理"},{"level":2,"text":"平台检测与环境","id":"平台检测与环境"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"集合与算法库","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/dart-language-async/core-libraries/collections-algorithms"},"next":{"title":"FFI 与原生互操作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/dart-language-async/core-libraries/dart-ffi-interop"}}